    "info": "Dedicated Copter-4.7.0 SITL sysid 31 with --gimbal + servo mount (MNT1_TYPE=1) and CAM1_TYPE=1.\nConnection: bind 0.0.0.0:14570 → remote 127.0.0.1:14571.\n\nMeasured firmware behaviour (confirm delivery, COMMAND_LONG):\n- gimbal aim (DO_MOUNT_CONTROL) pitch=-20 yaw=10 → COMMAND_ACK result 0\n- gimbal set-mode mode=2 (MAVLINK_TARGETING) → COMMAND_ACK result 0\n- gimbal roi-set lat=-35.363262 lon=149.165237 alt=584 → COMMAND_ACK result 0\n- gimbal roi-clear → COMMAND_ACK result 0\n\nHarness fires all four injects; verdict debug names: aim status, mode status, roi set status, roi clear status.",
